@startuml

title Push-based Referral \nNew Hope Medical Partners is a participant of Big Health Exchange \nUniversity Health is a participant of Valley Region HIE \nValley Region HIE is a participant of Big Health Exchange \nBig Health Exchange does not have any central service endpoints; it is peer to peer

actor "Dr. Suwati \nat New Hope Medical Partners" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_actor1
participant "New Hope Medical Partners'\nEHR" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr
participant "Big Health Exchange\nDirectory" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir
participant "Valley Region XCDR \nCross-Community \nDocument Reliable Interchange" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr
participant "University Health XDR \nCross-Enterprise \nDocument Reliable Interchange" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xdr
actor "Dr. Santos \nat University Health" as ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_actor2

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_actor1 -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr: "Refer Patient to Dr. Santos\n@University Health"
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir: Search Orgs for University Health
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr: Org 1.2.3.3
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search Practitioners for Dr. Santos
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return Practitioner Resource
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search for Relationship between\nDr. Santos and University Health
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return PractitionerRole Resource

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Dr. Santos practices at University Health. Need an endpoint.

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir: Search for OrganizationAffiliation \nwhere University Health\nis participatingOrganization
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr: : Return OrganizationAffiliation6 Resources

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : University Health is a Responder for Valley Region HIE.\nIs New Hope Medical Partners an Initiator?

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search for OrganizationAffiliation \nwhere Valley Region HIE is organization
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return OrganizationAffiliation6 Resources

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Not a member. Valley Region HIE also federates.\nIs there access to Valley Region HIE?

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search for OrganizationAffiliation \nwhere Valley Region HIE is participatingOrganization
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return OrganizationAffiliation5 Resources
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search for OrganiztionAffiliation \nwhere Big Health Exchange is organization
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return OrganizationAffliation4 Resources

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : New Hope can Initiate in Big Health Exchange,\nand Valley Region Responds.

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr : Transmit Referral. HCID=1.2.3; intendedRecipient=dr.santos@universityhealth.org

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr : Message destined for this community.

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir : Search for PractitionerRole \nwith telecom = dr.santos@universityhealth.org
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_dir --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr : Return Resource

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr : Message should go to University Health.

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xdr : Forward message

note over ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xdr : Message addressed to Dr. Santos.

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xdr -> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_actor2 : Deliver message

ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xdr --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr : Return success
ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_xcdr --> ITI_Comprehensive_multi_seq_ehr : Return success

@enduml